# Use an allowlist so credentials, camera photos and model weights cannot enter
# the Docker build context, even when new private directories are added later.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements-vision.lock
!run.py
!hotpot/
!hotpot/**
!static/
!static/**

# Also exclude Python caches nested inside the allowed source directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.secrets/
.env
.env.*
